16-09-25T19:27:04","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.932085394859314,"text_excerpt":"Stopped in for a quick dinner a week or so ago despite the bad reviews on here. We actually enjoyed our meal though.The prices were decent as well. I got the sushi dinner special which I thought was a great deal: salad, soup and 3 rolls for like $14. I got the crunchy roll, spicy tuna, and salmon and avocado roll. They all were delicious and I even had leftovers. The boyfriend liked his noodle and chicken dish as well. Didn't really see anything bad about the restaurant on this trip. It seems like a decent place for a quick low-key dinner."},{"business_id":"q39t6-a47CLf1RTyqu9CYg","review_id":"SidaQ4l7MrWc0qyiNr58oQ","date":"2015-10-22T11:18:27","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.922909677028656,"text_excerpt":"From living in California where the best sushi is, this place is pretty close to it. The food is good, been here three times and never had any issue at all. Prices are great, happy hours prices are just better. My husband and I ate for $13 during happy hour. Service is great and fast. I haven't had an issue here and so far this is the best sushi I've had in the area since we've moved here a few months ago, but the the best sushi I've ever had."},{"business_id":"q39t6-a47CLf1RTyqu9CYg","review_id":"9obZn8L0CitrW-AikKxA7g","date":"2019-02-16T02:53:09","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9160378575325012,"text_excerpt":"This is one of the better sushi places around. The food is always fresh and tasty. Great service and attentive staff. Would highly recommend this place."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"q39t6-a47CLf1RTyqu9CYg","photo_id":"-fwVupkcRvWSyXpx3IuMVg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/-fwVupkcRvWSyXpx3IuMVg.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
